// Base build settings for the SEPTATracker app target.
//
// The Google Maps API key comes from Config/Secrets.xcconfig, which is gitignored.
// Copy Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig to Config/Secrets.xcconfig and fill it in.
// Without it the app builds and runs; directions fall back to opening Google Maps.

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
